OL,3,CMan due in court after fatal dog
OL,4,Cattack which killed 55-year-old man
OL,6,FPolice have charged a man over the
OL,7,Fkilling of another man who died
OL,8,Ffollowing a dog attack in Wakefield.
OL,10,FLee Ellis has been charged with
OL,11,Fmanslaughter after the attack on a
OL,12,Fdisused rail line on Blacker Lane in
OL,13,FCalder Grove on Saturday.
OL,15,FThe victim, who police have not named,
OL,16,Fwas found injured and taken to
OL,17,Fhospital in a critical condition,
OL,18,Fwhere he sadly later died.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/2
