PN,33102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1787042885
OL,3,CMan due in court after fatal dog
OL,4,Cattack which killed 55-year-old man
OL,6,FEllis, 55, of Calder Grove, has also
OL,7,Fbeen accused of being in charge of a
OL,8,Fdangerously out of control dog causing
OL,9,Finjury resulting in death.
OL,11,FHe is remanded into custody and is due
OL,12,Fto appear before Leeds Magistrates
OL,13,FCourt on Tuesday.
OL,15,FShortly after Saturday's incident,
OL,16,Fpolice seized a German Shepherd dog
OL,17,Fwhich was still being held in police
OL,18,Fkennels on Tuesday morning.
OL,20,FThe victim's family are being
OL,21,Fsupported by specialist officers.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/2
